  <model metaid="meta_tirzepatide_kidney" id="tirzepatide_kidney" name="Model for the renal excretion of the tirzepatide metabolites." substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Model for the renal excretion of the tirzepatide metabolites.</p>
        <p>Tirzepatide is not excreted in the urine; its metabolites are filtered
with a clearance relative to the glomerular filtration rate (GFR), which
scales with the renal function.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>version</strong> 1</p>
          <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
